~ bush

Mira.Neutral: Yes, this is [[indeed|in fact]] a bush
- Party talk
	Daze.Neutral: This is certainly is a bush.
	Asteria.Neutral: This is a bush, right?
	Alcine.Neutral: Mhm...
- Others talk
	Yaru.Neutral: it... does look like a bush...
	Maple.Neutral: It may look like a bush, but we're not sure...
	Feni.Neutral: Are yall serious? This can't be anything but a bush!
- Scream
	Mira.OpenMouth: AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA
	if Party.has_member("Erinn"):
		Erinn: Mira, what are you doing?
- Talk a lot
	Mira.Smile: Yeah, sure i can say a *bunch of stuff*.
	Mira.Smile: I just like the sound of my voice, *beep boop.
	Mira.Smile: So how's your day bush? [p]Anything going on?
	[wait=0.5][hide][next=auto]
	Mira.Smile: Yeah I thought so.
	Mira.Smile: The purpose of this dialog is to test text sounds and dialog skipping.
	$> picture("Placeholder")
	Mira.Smile: Look at this cool texture
	$> picture_clear()
	Mira.Smile: I can hold shift to skip all of it.
	Also here are some thought sounds.
	Mira.Curious: Ok I think that's enough.
- End
=> END

~ travel
Where to go?
- Pyrson
	Part?
	- Start
		$> travel_to("Pyrson")
	- My room
		$> travel_to("Pyrson;HomeBuilding-MyRoom", Vector2(178, 482))
	- Town hall
		$> travel_to("Pyrson;TownHall", Vector2(443, 179))
- Temple Woods
	Part?
	- Start
		$> travel_to("TempleWoods")
	- Lake
		$> travel_to("TempleWoods", Vector2.ZERO, 1)
	- Small temple
		$> travel_to_coords("TempleWoods", Vector2(59, 0), 1)
	- Road
		$> travel_to("TempleWoods", Vector2.ZERO, 2)
- Amberelm
	Part?
	- Start
		$> travel_to("Amberelm")
	- Upstairs
		$> travel_to("Amberelm", Vector2(155, 347), 0, 7)
	- Ruined Town
		$> travel_to("Amberelm", Vector2(1520, -285), 2)
- Shard Gardens
	Part?
	- Start
		$> travel_to("ShardGardens")
	- Underground 1
		$> travel_to("ShardGardens", Vector2(-150, 622), 1)
	- Underground 2
		$> travel_to("ShardGardens", Vector2(-130, -100), 1)
	- Lakeside
		$> travel_to("ShardGardens", Vector2(-223, -697), 2)
- WitheredLeaves
	$> travel_to("WitheredLeaves")
- Bunker
	Sector
	- A
		$> travel_to("BunkerSectorA")
=> END

