~ add_to_party
What to do?
- Manage party
	we shall
	- Add to party
		~ add
		Who to add?
		- Mira
			$> Party.add("Mira")
		- Alcine
			$> Party.add("Alcine")
		- Daze
			$> Party.add("Daze")
		- Asteria
			$> Party.add("Asteria")
		- Erinn
			$> Party.add("Erinn")
	- Standard full party
		$> heal_party()
		$> Party.reset_party()
		$> Party.add("Alcine")
		$> Party.add("Asteria")
		$> Party.add("Daze")
	- Clear and set Leader
		$> Party.reset_party()
		$> Party.Leader = null
		=> add
	- Make everyone controllable
		$> Party.make_everyone_controllable()
- Abilities
	go on
	- Unlock all abilities
		$> unlock_all_abilities()
	- Add state testing abilities
		$> add_test_state(Party.Leader)
	- Give every ability
		$> give_every_ability()
- Full heal
	$> heal_party()
- Give Mira lots of HP
	$> Party.Leader.Health = 9999
- Reset all members
	$> Party.reset_all_members()
$> give_control()

=> END

