~ chapter_select
Event select
- Petrogon fight
	$> Event.flags.clear()
	$> to_day = 0
	$> to_time = TOD.NIGHT
	$> Event.remove_flag("Player/NoBag")
	$> Event.add_flag("Player/Flame")
	$> travel_to("TempleWoods", Vector2(1272, -966), 2)
- Maple Meet Scene
	$> day = 2
	$> time_of_day = TOD.NIGHT
	$>> textbox_open("story_1", "maple_meet")
- Going to shard gardens
	$> to_day = 3
	$> to_time = TOD.AFTERNOON
	$>> time_transition()
=> END

~ jump_playtest
This is the end of this segment.
You will now jump to a part a bit further in the game, and you have met two other party members.
It's still pretty unfinished tho.
$> day = 3
$> to_time = TOD.AFTERNOON
$> remove_flag("UI/HideDate")
$>> time_transition()
=> END

~ waste_time
$> take_control()
$> Transition.wipe()
$> progress_by_time(1)
$> time_transition()
$>> Transition.unwipe()
=> END

~ demo_credits
$> take_control()
$> play_credits()
=> END
